    <briefdescription>
<para>Phase B2: Traversal edge-case tests for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_column_lineage_tracker" kindref="compound">ColumnLineageTracker</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Test IDs: MCH-LN01..MCH-LN04</para>
</simplesect>
MCH-LN01 <ref refid="structthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_column_ref" kindref="compound">ColumnRef</ref> equality and inequality operators work correctly MCH-LN02 <ref refid="structthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_column_ref_1a5f21f16e59e39b3d454d41be8a2b803e" kindref="member">ColumnRef::toString()</ref> returns &quot;table.column&quot; canonical format MCH-LN03 <ref refid="structthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_column_ref_1accb3fcec5d0bfa8fe16108650ef6db1a" kindref="member">ColumnRef::toJSON()</ref> / fromJSON() round-trip preserves all fields MCH-LN04 <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1metadata_1aae7ca3e7a55cd13ba52c35097bc8b085" kindref="member">TransformationType</ref> string conversion round-trips for all types</para>
<para>Self-contained: no RocksDB, no network I/O, no background threads. Canonical PRNG seed: kLineageSeed = 42.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="column__lineage_8h" kindref="compound">include/metadata/column_lineage.h</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>src/metadata/ROADMAP.md — Phase B lineage traversal items </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
